<title>RUSSIA: Russia Duma asks gvt to withdraw spending cut plan.</title>
<headline>Russia Duma asks gvt to withdraw spending cut plan.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The budget committee of the State Duma lower house of Russian parliament on Thursday asked the government to withdraw its plan to cut spending, and said deputies should consider alternative ideas.</p>
<p>Itar-Tass news agency quoted Duma deputies as saying that the chamber, which is dominated by communists, should consider an alternative plan put forward by a group of deputies when it debates the issue on Friday.</p>
</text>
